Usage: codeintel build plan [ARGS]

Show build plan with status and reason for each target.

╭─ Parameters ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ TARGETS --targets            Target names to plan (e.g., function_types,   │
│   --empty-targets            call_graph). [env var:                          │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_TARGETS,                   │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_TARGETS] [default: (none)] │
│ MODULE --module -m           Plan all targets in a module (ingestion,        │
│                              graphs, analytics, export). [env var:           │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_MODULE,                    │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_MODULE] [default: (none)]  │
│ ALL --all -a                 Plan all targets across all modules. [env var:  │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_ALL,                       │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_ALL] [default: false]      │
│ FORCE --force --empty-force  Mark specific targets as forced (repeatable).   │
│   -f                         [env var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_FORCE,           │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_FORCE] [default: (none)]   │
│ OUTPUT --output -o           Output file path (stdout if not specified).     │
│                              [env var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_OUTPUT,          │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_OUTPUT] [default: (none)]  │
│ *                            [env var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_*] [default: *]  │
│ ROOT --root -r               Explicit project root directory. [env var:      │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_ROOT,                      │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_ROOT] [default: (none)]    │
│ OUTPUT-FORMAT                Output format. [choices: text, json, jsonl]     │
│   --output-format            [env var: CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_OUTPUT_FORMAT,   │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_OUTPUT_FORMAT] [default:   │
│                              text]                                           │
│ JSON --json                  Alias for --output-format json. [env var:       │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_JSON,                      │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_JSON] [default: false]     │
│ VERBOSE --verbose -v         Increase verbosity (0=warnings, 1=info,         │
│                              2=debug). [env var:                             │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_VERBOSE,                   │
│                              CODEINTEL_BUILD_PLAN_VERBOSE] [default: 0]      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
